-- a switch binds its fields in the statement expression; the scrutinee is x: a switch is emitted
-- by the caller wrapping x; the test below is on the fswitch form's shape through #show
-- (the compile-and-run check is experiments/fo/run.py, which decodes a program and runs gcc)
